      "category": "ai",
      "title": {
        "zh": "Hipo Hipo · 让 AI 记忆变得好理解",
        "en": "Hipo Hipo · Making AI memory relatable"
      },
      "year": "2026",
      "summary": {
        "zh": "把抽象的 AI 产品能力，变成有情绪、有场景的社交媒体内容。",
        "en": "Turning abstract AI features into relatable scenarios and social-first stories."
